                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When Attached Convocation of Eagles model is Killed, one Enemy model within 8&quot; gains a Stunned Marker.
Choose one Eagles of the Jwar Isles, not recruited into this Warband, Recruit that model and place it Elsewhere.
That model gains Flank and enters the Battlefield using those rules.
This Enhancement may be given to Animal, Swarm and Insignificant models.

Requirement [Convocation of Eagles]</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
