      <profiles>
        <profile name="Blue Gale Scouting Party" id="22cd-b629-524d-1264" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Shortbow Ranged Weapons Lose the Reload Trait.
- During Deployment Tengu models with both Cloudwalk and Move 5 gain +1 Move for the rest of the game.
- Shortbow and Call Lightning Ranged Weapons on Tengu profiles gain Lightweight.
- Once per game, in the Starting Phase, Friendly models may be placed within 1&quot; of their current position but not in the ZoC of an Enemy model
- Enemy models cannot use Move Ki Boosts on the first and last turn of the game

Permitted [Models with a Move Boost, Birds, Ronin Birds]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
