          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Play in the Starting Phase.
Until the End Phase Friendly Tribesman models gain the Vengeance [Animal] trait and their Ranged Weapons gain Bleed (1/1) when Targeting an Animal model.
If a non-lnsignificant Enemy Animal model is Killed, Friendly Tribesmen models gain Tough (+1) until the End Phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
