        <profile name="Way of the Ancient Warrior" id="414d-7646-d489-f824" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Friendly Koroko models may not be Targeted by Enemy models unless they are the closest model to that Enemy model.
- Haiatake models gain Dodge (1), Feint (1), and Ranged Defence (1).
- Friendly Haiatake models gain Coordinated Attack [Bushi].
- Haiatake models cost -1 Rice to recruit individually and 28 Rice for both Haiatake Guard.

Permitted [Bushi, Koroko, Tribesman]
Exclusion [more than 1 Kurama model]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
