                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model uses its Flank trait, you may choose to deploy it anywhere valid on the Battlefield that is more than 4&quot; from any Enemy models instead of choosing a table edge.</characteristic>
