            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Friendly models gain Camouflage (4&quot;).
- When an Enemy model is Killed, Heal X marked wounds among Friendly models. X is equal to the number of Enemy models that have been killed or removed from play.
- Enemy models with Bleed Markers gain Slow.
- Friendly Bushi models gain Prowess [Attack]:(1) against Enemy models that were unsuccessful on an Intimidate test this turn.

Permitted [Outcast models, Birds, Ronin Birds, Plainsmen, Ronin Plainsmen]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
