                <characteristic name="Ki Feat Description" typeId="3886-242b-fb70-5c88">This model gains Combo Attack (0).
If this model&apos;s Melee Attack is successful and causes any Damage the Target gains a Blind Marker.
This Ki Feat lasts until the end of the current Melee Exchange.</characteristic>
