            <profile name="Final Flight" id="ed26-e428-04ae-a730" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Attached model loses Cloudwalk and cannot gain it.
When the Attached model gains or spends a Virtue Token, it gains one Ki Token.
When the Attached model is Killed, distribute its remaining Ki Tokens amongst Friendly, non-Kakyu models.

Requirement [Tengu with Cloudwalk]</characteristic>
